 at a home for adults with complex needs. She liked the job, but it could be gruelling â€“ especially when clients hurled furniture at her or ripped sinks off walls.</p><p>Then, in May 2013, came the death of Lee Rigby, a drummer with the Second Battalion of the Royal Regiment of Fusiliers who was murdered by two Islamist terrorists using machetes. Sandra didnâ€™t know Rigby, Wilding notes, but his death nonetheless brought her pent-up rage to the surface. She began watching videos on Facebook by a man named Tommy Robinson, who wanted to know why the countryâ€™s brave soldiers were being murdered. By September of that year, she was protesting on the streets of London.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/books/2026/jul/21/these-wild-english-by-nicola-wilding-review-explaining-a-mothers-drift-to-the-far-right">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;yVkJ-s9WNrjUc9P9gC3nGizQ05gpwQj7nOMU6mLCuNoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;eCXo9vOdn21fgACCnIs3yiDeRdXsQvUv2y3RYkNE5-Aƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MCkz2sewRoZk49BtffymMmI1UXWXd1c2lMJzbM93ypsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0K59UMwTRxXpk1qOjSCx8upydsmbpXEHRXMbYi_kb5gƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oKNSMYPQuB2_-rpGw9fAtYPoozU1SCu1wJbWjr5Rqlcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NH4I11N4eD-tgrBcINtOyEaxYZzA-SPfhD6J5pwiimEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;p2NlaJQW-O9UUvCex0_JuOzjkiTo0l-kiihtXtcPAK4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒer