urdered by two Islamist terrorists using machetes. Sandra didnâ€™t know Rigby, Wilding notes, but his death nonetheless brought her pent-up rage to the surface. She began watching videos on Facebook by a man named Tommy Robinson, who wanted to know why the countryâ€™s brave soldiers were being murdered. By September of that year, she was protesting on the streets of London.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/books/2026/jul/21/these-wild-english-by-nicola-wilding-review-explaining-a-mothers-drift-to-the-far-right">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZsvG3c-HmN_xroJnKUeEM-y-71D5diA3pmxBRKe6GAgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx^These Wild English by Nicola Wilding review â€“ explaining a motherâ€™s drift to the far rightƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xLqRyI7edSQRZVwOuZD_0f6rYsJLIkaH2e8rbmb78CUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WxtXH282NtK7uSt2tQnc-9_xawOQKfzlz-xLYxFCM30ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx…https://www.theguardian.com/books/2026/jul/21/these-wild-english-by-nicola-wilding-review-explaining-a-mothers-drift-to-the-far-rightƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VWdo_mUhMDMNO10Q-yM5lyyu8wum_eVo9hY2UgPCW0sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxXthese-wild-english-by-nicola-wilding-review-explaining-a-mother-s-drift-to-the-far-rightƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zAWJGgJirqH7lcBuTFbJksoezQ3cX17WK6wSZ6Ir0AEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;sJGVaqNttVcFe3cCWt9JhH2F5VCHNrRuKjfHc1XvQNgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒeri